      "Determination of Permanent and Temporary Hardness: Boiling water sample precipitates temporary hardness (bicarbonates decompose: Ca(HCO_3)_2 \\to CaCO_3 \\downarrow + H_2O + CO_2); filtering precipitated carbonates and titrating filtrate gives Permanent Hardness; \\text{Temporary Hardness} = \\text{Total} - \\text{Permanent}.",
